)" dir="auto" data-turn-id="54f8e222-86b1-4057-ac93-b64041a4141d" data-turn-id-container="54f8e222-86b1-4057-ac93-b64041a4141d" data-testid="conversation-turn-1" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">You said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-3 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="54f8e222-86b1-4057-ac93-b64041a4141d" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="flex flex-col w-fit max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%) items-start self-end rtl:items-end rtl:self-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 w-full"><div data-custom-highlighting-behavior="boundary" class="A_HxFq_root" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-root"><input id="_r_5m_" aria-controls="_r_5l_" class="A_HxFq_toggleCheckbox" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-toggle-checkbox" type="checkbox"><div id="_r_5l_" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-content" class="A_HxFq_content"><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap">am working on my final year project but got staked,it an online postal courier system</div></div><label for="_r_5m_" class="A_HxFq_toggleControl select-none" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-toggle"><span class="A_HxFq_showMoreLabel">Show more</span><span class="A_HxFq_showLessLabel">Show less</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" class="A_HxFq_toggleIcon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ba3792" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></label></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Your message actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy message" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><div class="contents"></div></div></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="84a0b22e-f19e-46ac-ba60-46aa6fb6db02" data-is-intersecting="true"><div class="relative w-full overflow-visible"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="84a0b22e-f19e-46ac-ba60-46aa6fb6db02" data-turn-id-container="84a0b22e-f19e-46ac-ba60-46aa6fb6db02" data-testid="conversation-turn-2" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="05ff04b5-08df-4482-bb22-02140808db64" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="246">An online postal courier system is a solid final year project because it combines real-world logistics with web application features. If you’re stuck, the easiest way forward is to break it into smaller modules and define the core workflow first.</p>
<p data-start="248" data-end="289">Here’s a practical structure you can use.</p>
<h1 data-start="291" data-end="302">Core Idea</h1>
<p data-start="304" data-end="347">An Online Postal Courier System lets users:</p>
<ul data-start="349" data-end="498">
<li data-start="349" data-end="370">
<p data-start="351" data-end="370">Send parcels online</p>
</li>
<li data-start="371" data-end="389">
<p data-start="373" data-end="389">Track deliveries</p>
</li>
<li data-start="390" data-end="416">
<p data-start="392" data-end="416">Calculate shipping costs</p>
</li>
<li data-start="417" data-end="448">
<p data-start="419" data-end="448">Manage pickups and deliveries</p>
</li>
<li data-start="449" data-end="498">
<p data-start="451" data-end="498">Allow admins/staff to manage parcels and routes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="500" data-end="620">Think of it like a simplified version of <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">DHL</span></span> or <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">FedEx</span></span>.</p>
<hr data-start="622" data-end="625">
<h1 data-start="627" data-end="648">Recommended Modules</h1>
<h2 data-start="650" data-end="667">1. User Module</h2>
<p data-start="668" data-end="678">Users can:</p>
<ul data-start="680" data-end="830">
<li data-start="680" data-end="696">
<p data-start="682" data-end="696">Register/login</p>
</li>
<li data-start="697" data-end="723">
<p data-start="699" data-end="723">Create shipment requests</p>
</li>
<li data-start="724" data-end="757">
<p data-start="726" data-end="757">Enter sender &amp; receiver details</p>
</li>
<li data-start="758" data-end="779">
<p data-start="760" data-end="779">Track parcel status</p>
</li>
<li data-start="780" data-end="803">
<p data-start="782" data-end="803">View shipment history</p>
</li>
<li data-start="804" data-end="830">
<p data-start="806" data-end="830">Make payments (optional)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="832" data-end="835">
<h2 data-start="837" data-end="855">2. Admin Module</h2>
<p data-start="856" data-end="866">Admin can:</p>
<ul data-start="868" data-end="994">
<li data-start="868" data-end="882">
<p data-start="870" data-end="882">Manage users</p>
</li>
<li data-start="883" data-end="901">
<p data-start="885" data-end="901">View all parcels</p>
</li>
<li data-start="902" data-end="926">
<p data-start="904" data-end="926">Update delivery status</p>
</li>
<li data-start="927" data-end="951">
<p data-start="929" data-end="951">Assign delivery agents</p>
</li>
<li data-start="952" data-end="970">
<p data-start="954" data-end="970">Generate reports</p>
</li>
<li data-start="971" data-end="994">
<p data-start="973" data-end="994">Manage pricing/routes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="996" data-end="999">
<h2 data-start="1001" data-end="1027">3. Courier/Staff Module</h2>
<p data-start="1028" data-end="1038">Staff can:</p>
<ul data-start="1040" data-end="1143">
<li data-start="1040" data-end="1066">
<p data-start="1042" data-end="1066">View assigned deliveries</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1067" data-end="1091">
<p data-start="1069" data-end="1091">Update parcel location</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1092" data-end="1116">
<p data-start="1094" data-end="1116">Mark delivered parcels</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1117" data-end="1143">
<p data-start="1119" data-end="1143">Upload proof of delivery</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1145" data-end="1148">
<h1 data-start="1150" data-end="1165">Main Features</h1>
<h2 data-start="1167" data-end="1185">Parcel Tracking</h2>
<p data-start="1186" data-end="1221">This is the most important feature.</p>
<p data-start="1223" data-end="1239">Statuses can be:</p>
<ul data-start="1241" data-end="1323">
<li data-start="1241" data-end="1250">
<p data-start="1243" data-end="1250">Pending</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1251" data-end="1262">
<p data-start="1253" data-end="1262">Picked Up</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1263" data-end="1275">
<p data-start="1265" data-end="1275">In Transit</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1276" data-end="1292">
<p data-start="1278" data-end="1292">Arrived at Hub</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1293" data-end="1311">
<p data-start="1295" data-end="1311">Out for Delivery</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1312" data-end="1323">
<p data-start="1314" data-end="1323">Delivered</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1325" data-end="1357">Generate a tracking number like:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1359" data-end="1383"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>PCS202600123</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1385" data-end="1388">
<h2 data-start="1390" data-end="1417">Delivery Cost Calculator</h2>
<p data-start="1419" data-end="1448">You can calculate cost using:</p>
<ul data-start="1450" data-end="1504">
<li data-start="1450" data-end="1458">
<p data-start="1452" data-end="1458">Weight</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1459" data-end="1469">
<p data-start="1461" data-end="1469">Distance</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1470" data-end="1504">
<p data-start="1472" data-end="1504">Delivery type (standard/express)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1506" data-end="1514">Example:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1516" data-end="1561"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Cost = Base Fee + (Weight × Rate)</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1563" data-end="1605">You can even visualize formulas like this:</p>
<p data-start="1607" data-end="1644"><span class="inline-block align-middle"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C = B + (W \times R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.07153em;">C</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.05017em;">B</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">W</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="1646" data-end="1652">Where:</p>
<ul data-start="1653" data-end="1731">
<li data-start="1653" data-end="1673">
<p data-start="1655" data-end="1673"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span> = total cost</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1674" data-end="1692">
<p data-start="1676" data-end="1692"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span></span></span></span> = base fee</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1693" data-end="1709">
<p data-start="1695" data-end="1709"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">W</span></span></span></span> = weight</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1710" data-end="1731">
<p data-start="1712" data-end="1731"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span></span></span></span> = rate per kg</p>
</li>
</ul>
