<h1 data-start="3257" data-end="3284">Problem Statement Example</h1>
<blockquote data-start="3286" data-end="3547">
<p data-start="3288" data-end="3547">Traditional postal systems are slow and difficult to track manually. Customers lack real-time updates on parcel movement. This project aims to develop an online postal courier system that improves parcel tracking, shipment management, and delivery efficiency.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="3549" data-end="3552">
<h1 data-start="3554" data-end="3573">Objective Example</h1>
<ul data-start="3575" data-end="3732">
<li data-start="3575" data-end="3625">
<p data-start="3577" data-end="3625">To develop a web-based courier management system</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3626" data-end="3663">
<p data-start="3628" data-end="3663">To enable real-time parcel tracking</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3664" data-end="3703">
<p data-start="3666" data-end="3703">To improve delivery record management</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3704" data-end="3732">
<p data-start="3706" data-end="3732">To reduce manual paperwork</p>
</li>
</ul>
