<hr data-start="497" data-end="500">
<h1 data-start="502" data-end="507">FIX</h1>
<p data-start="509" data-end="534">Rename the file properly.</p>
<p data-start="536" data-end="544">Example:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="546" data-end="578"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Home.jsx</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="580" data-end="584">NOT:</p>
<ul data-start="585" data-end="613">
<li data-start="585" data-end="593">
<p data-start="587" data-end="593"><code data-start="587" data-end="593">.txt</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="594" data-end="603">
<p data-start="596" data-end="603"><code data-start="596" data-end="603">.json</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="604" data-end="613">
<p data-start="606" data-end="613"><code data-start="606" data-end="613">.html</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="615" data-end="618">
<h1 data-start="620" data-end="653">2. YOU PASTED BROKEN CHARACTERS</h1>
<p data-start="655" data-end="710">Sometimes copying from browsers adds hidden characters.</p>
<p data-start="712" data-end="772">Delete everything inside the file and paste again carefully.</p>
<hr data-start="774" data-end="777">
<h1 data-start="779" data-end="802">3. JSX NOT RECOGNIZED</h1>
<p data-start="804" data-end="860">At the bottom-right of VS Code, check the language mode.</p>
<p data-start="862" data-end="876">It should say:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="877" data-end="917"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>JavaScript React</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="919" data-end="930">If it says:</p>
<ul data-start="931" data-end="957">
<li data-start="931" data-end="943">
<p data-start="933" data-end="943">Plain Text</p>
</li>
<li data-start="944" data-end="950">
<p data-start="946" data-end="950">HTML</p>
</li>
<li data-start="951" data-end="957">
<p data-start="953" data-end="957">JSON</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="959" data-end="988">then syntax colors disappear.</p>
<hr data-start="990" data-end="993">
<h1 data-start="995" data-end="1005">FIX THIS</h1>
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1038">Bottom-right corner in VS Code:</p>
<p data-start="1040" data-end="1081">Click the current language name → choose:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1083" data-end="1123"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>JavaScript React</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
