</li>
<li data-start="151" data-end="171">
<p data-start="153" data-end="171">bad JSX formatting</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="173" data-end="245">Those usually happen when copying code from browsers/Word/AI formatting.</p>
<p data-start="247" data-end="335">The code you pasted now is clean JSX and valid React, which is why it works immediately.</p>
<p data-start="337" data-end="374">Your VS Code colors returned because:</p>
