ive flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="162">The design looks very strong visually for desktop — modern, premium, and professional. The gradients, glass cards, and spacing give it a real production-app feel.</p>
<p data-start="164" data-end="268">But right now, it is <strong data-start="185" data-end="220">NOT fully mobile responsive yet</strong> because the layout uses many fixed values like:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="270" data-end="327"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky top-(--sticky-padding-top) z-2 select-none"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼo">padding</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼk">'80px'</span><br><span class="ͼo">width</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼk">'400px'</span><br><span class="ͼo">fontSize</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼk">'4rem'</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="329" data-end="355">On phones, that can cause:</p>
<ul data-start="356" data-end="494">
<li data-start="356" data-end="374">
<p data-start="358" data-end="374">text overflowing</p>
</li>
<li data-start="375" data-end="399">
<p data-start="377" data-end="399">cards going off-screen</p>
</li>
<li data-start="400" data-end="418">
<p data-start="402" data-end="418">navbar squeezing</p>
</li>
<li data-start="419" data-end="441">
<p data-start="421" data-end="441">horizontal scrolling</p>
</li>
<li data-start="442" data-end="470">
<p data-start="444" data-end="470">buttons becoming too large</p>
</li>
<li data-start="471" data-end="494">
<p data-start="473" data-end="494">hero section breaking</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="496" data-end="508">For example:</p>
<ul data-start="509" data-end="692">
<li data-start="509" data-end="585">
<p data-start="511" data-end="585"><code data-start="511" data-end="528">display: 'flex'</code> with two large columns will stack badly on small screens</p>
</li>
<li data-start="586" data-end="648">
<p data-start="588" data-end="648">the hero right-side cards may disappear outside the viewport</p>
</li>
<li data-start="649" data-end="692">
<p data-start="651" data-end="692"><code data-start="651" data-end="668">padding: '80px'</code> is too large for mobile</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="694" data-end="732">A phone-compatible version should use:</p>
<ul data-start="733" data-end="871">
<li data-start="733" data-end="760">
<p data-start="735" data-end="760">responsive flex direction</p>
</li>
<li data-start="761" data-end="791">
<p data-start="763" data-end="791">smaller font sizes on mobile</p>
</li>
<li data-start="792" data-end="812">
<p data-start="794" data-end="812">widths like <code data-start="806" data-end="812">100%</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="813" data-end="835">
<p data-start="815" data-end="835">conditional stacking</p>
</li>
<li data-start="836" data-end="871">
<p data-start="838" data-end="871">media queries or responsive logic</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="873" data-end="881">Example:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="883" data-end="950"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky top-(--sticky-padding-top) z-2 select-none"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼo">flexDirection</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼm">window</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>innerWidth </span><span class="ͼg">&lt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">768</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">?</span><span> </span><span class="ͼk">'column'</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">:</span><span> </span><span class="ͼk">'row'</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="952" data-end="964">or with CSS:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="966" data-end="1067"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky top-(--sticky-padding-top) z-2 select-none"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0