 class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="90">I think the BEST direction for this project is not full dark mode and not full light mode.</p>
<p data-start="92" data-end="149">The most amazing look for a courier/tracking platform is:</p>
<ul data-start="151" data-end="306">
<li data-start="151" data-end="174">
<p data-start="153" data-end="174">soft modern gradients</p>
</li>
<li data-start="175" data-end="190">
<p data-start="177" data-end="190">glassmorphism</p>
</li>
<li data-start="191" data-end="247">
<p data-start="193" data-end="247">white/light sections mixed with premium color sections</p>
</li>
<li data-start="248" data-end="265">
<p data-start="250" data-end="265">smooth contrast</p>
</li>
<li data-start="266" data-end="282">
<p data-start="268" data-end="282">subtle shadows</p>
</li>
<li data-start="283" data-end="306">
<p data-start="285" data-end="306">vibrant accent colors</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="308" data-end="330">Something inspired by:</p>
<ul data-start="331" data-end="417">
<li data-start="331" data-end="339">
<p data-start="333" data-end="339">Stripe</p>
</li>
<li data-start="340" data-end="348">
<p data-start="342" data-end="348">Linear</p>
</li>
<li data-start="349" data-end="360">
<p data-start="351" data-end="360">Notion AI</p>
</li>
<li data-start="361" data-end="388">
<p data-start="363" data-end="388">modern fintech dashboards</p>
</li>
<li data-start="389" data-end="417">
<p data-start="391" data-end="417">premium SaaS landing pages</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="419" data-end="475">For YOUR project specifically, I’d recommend this style:</p>
<h3 data-start="477" data-end="491">Main Theme</h3>
<ul data-start="492" data-end="659">
<li data-start="492" data-end="527">
<p data-start="494" data-end="527">Soft white/light gray backgrounds</p>
</li>
<li data-start="528" data-end="557">
<p data-start="530" data-end="557">Deep emerald + teal accents</p>
</li>
<li data-start="558" data-end="571">
<p data-start="560" data-end="571">Glass cards</p>
</li>
<li data-start="572" data-end="590">
<p data-start="574" data-end="590">Gradient buttons</p>
</li>
<li data-start="591" data-end="620">
<p data-start="593" data-end="620">Dark text on light sections</p>
</li>
<li data-start="621" data-end="659">
<p data-start="623" data-end="659">Occasional premium dark hero section</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="661" data-end="686">Why This Works Better</h3>
<p data-start="687" data-end="716">Courier systems need to feel:</p>
<ul data-start="717" data-end="776">
<li data-start="717" data-end="730">
<p data-start="719" data-end="730">trustworthy</p>
</li>
<li data-start="731" data-end="737">
<p data-start="733" data-end="737">fast</p>
</li>
<li data-start="738" data-end="752">
<p data-start="740" data-end="752">professional</p>
</li>
<li data-start="753" data-end="761">
<p data-start="755" data-end="761">modern</p>
</li>
<li data-start="762" data-end="776">
<p data-start="764" data-end="776">easy to read</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="778" data-end="810">Too much darkness makes it feel:</p>
<ul data-start="811" data-end="851">
<li data-start="811" data-end="819">
<p data-start="813" data-end="819">gaming</p>
</li>
<li data-start="820" data-end="828">
<p data-start="822" data-end="828">crypto</p>
</li>
<li data-start="829" data-end="843">
<p data-start="831" data-end="843">hacker-style</p>
</li>
<li data-start="844" data-end="851">
<p data-start="846" data-end="851">heavy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="853" data-end="971">A mixed premium UI feels more like:<br>
✅ real startup<br data-start="903" data-end="906">
✅ production app<br data-start="922" data-end="925">
✅ commercial SaaS<br data-start="942" data-end="945">
✅ modern delivery platform</p>
<p data-start="973" data-end="1002">The BIG improvement would be:</p>
<h1 data-start="1004" data-end="1026">New Visual Direction</h1>
<h3 data-start="1028" data-end="1036">HERO</h3>
<p data-start="1037" data-end="1077">Keep slightly dark premium gradient hero</p>
<h3 data-start="1079" data-end="1091">FEATURES</h3>
<p data-start="1092" data-end="1124">Switch to light background cards</p>
<h3 data-start="1126" data-end="1135">STATS</h3>
<p data-start="1136" data-end="1160">Use floating white cards</p>
<h3 data-start="1162" data-end="1169">CTA</h3>
<p data-start="1170" data-end="1193">Bright gradient section</p>
<h3 data-start="1195" data-end="1205">FOOTER</h3>
<p data-start="1206" data-end="1225">Dark compact footer</p>
<p data-start="1227" data-end="1281">That contrast makes the site feel MUCH more expensive.</p>
<p data-start="1283" data-end="1348">Also:<br>
Your current layout is already good.<br>
What’s missing now is:</p>
<ul data-start="1349" data-end="1434">
<li data-start="1349" data-end="1372">
<p data-start="1351" data-end="1372">premium color balance</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1373" data-end="1389">
<p data-start="1375" data-end="1389">spacing polish</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1390" data-end="1408">
<p data-start="1392" data-end="1408">lighter sections</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1409" data-end="1434">
<p data-start="1411" data-end="1434">better visual hierarchy</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1436" data-end="1482">That alone can take it from:<br>
“student project”</p>
<p data-start="1484" data-end="1486">to</p>
<p data-start="1488" data-end="1511">“real startup website”.</p>
<p data-start="1513" data-end="1567">And we can do it WITHOUT adding complicated libraries.</p>
<p data-start="1569" data-end="1775" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Next, I can give you:<br>
✅ a premium mixed-theme redesign<br data-start="1623" data-end="1626">
✅ still responsive<br data-start="1644" data-end="1647">
✅ still one file<br data-start="1663" data-end="1666">
✅ still safe React code<br data-start="1689" data-end="1692">
✅ cleaner spacing<br data-start="1709" data-end="1712">
✅ modern SaaS style<br data-start="1731" data-end="1734">
✅ mobile optimized<br data-start="1752" data-end="1755">
✅ no Tailwind needed</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-b2090418.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Bad response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span 